window.products.push({"id":824028,"name":"Brentwood Extra Wide Slot 4-Slice Toaster, Silver, One Size (BTWTS446S)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vc978KKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Use the Brentwood Appliances extra wide slot 4-slice toaster to heat toast, bagels, waffles, pastries, and more. It features 3 convenient functions: reheat, defrost, and cancel. Enjoy your preferred level of toast using the 6 setting shade selector. Safely remove toast using the extra lift lever. Simply remove the crumb tray for quick and easy cleanup. Toast any variety of bagels or artisan breads thanks to the extra wide slots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Vc978KKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brentwood","source_asin":"B07VFKZNZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VFKZNZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VFKZNZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":824029,"name":"NOVICA Multicolor Wood Leaf and Tree Sculpture, 8\" Tall 'Tree of Life'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tMerWHpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: \"I made this sculpture as a tribute to life,\" confides John Barrow. \"The different colors represent the joy of life, of feeling, and of having hope for the future. Its optimism is contagious.\" Barrow crafts the sculpture with hand-carved segments of cedar, mahogany and ishpingo woods. He stains the woods with colorful natural dyes.  - All natural dyes   About our Artist: John Barrow was born in London on September 22, 1934. After studying Engineering he traveled to Peru, in 1969, to work at a paper mill. His original contract was for eight weeks, but John ended up staying in Peru permanently.  John has always enjoyed woodwork; he learned the craft from his father, who was a carpenter. Carving became one of John's favorite pastimes, a spare-time hobby.  Living in Peru allowed me to get to know a variety of beautiful wood types. When I found time I would carve various furniture pieces, John explains. When I retired, I was finally able to dedicate myself completely to my passion, carving!”  I love to make all sorts of things. I am a perfectionist, so I prefer to look for the perfect wood type and take great care with each detail. I want to make something that is different than what you might usually see, so I have designed my own machines and tools to help me work wood in a different way.  Once a famous pianist saw some chairs I had made, and fell in love with their design. After buying a piano, he bought my chairs and asked me to paint them black, to match his piano. Honestly, painting those chairs was one of the hardest things I have ever had to do for a customer, because I love the natural look of wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tMerWHpzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00444TA22","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00444TA22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00444TA22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
