window.products.push({"id":824076,"name":"Fall Triple - Pumpkin Cream Pie, Cinnamon, and French Vanilla Scented 13 Ounce Mason Jar Candle by Our Own Candle Company, 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812T75oUeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our five ounce mini tins are a smaller version of our decorative tin candles. They contain the same special blend of Soy/Paraffin and the same amazing scents. Great for gifts and stocking stuffers! Our Own Candle Company started because we could not find a candle that had all the qualities we were looking for: no wasted wax, a great long lasting scent that spreads throughout the house, and a candle that lasts a very long time. We worked hard and did much experimentation until we found just the right combination of ingredients. The result is what we think is the perfect candle. We patented our unique wick straightener which ensures your wick is centered every time. We perfected our production process so you can be sure your candle is of the highest quality which is what our customers have come to expect. For Optimal Results: Keep wick trimmed to 1/4\" before lighting each time, Do not burn for more than 2 hours at a time, Allow wax to pool edge to edge during the first burn to avoid \"tunneling\", Remove all packaging including wick holder before lighting, Burn only on flat non-flammable surface, Always remove wick clippings and debris before lighting, Size of the room and if there is a draft/fan is also a consideration in ideal candle placement. 100% Customer Satisfaction Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812T75oUeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Our Own Candle Company","source_asin":"B01KUELE3M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KUELE3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KUELE3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
