window.products.push({"id":824127,"name":"GUPUP 16.4ft COB Turnable Rope Light,Warm White LED Strip Light,3000K 24V Tape Lights,1600 LEDs Density Light Strip with Dimmable Switch,Waterproof,3M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d+8xf6g+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra Bright&270°shining】This DC24V 320EDs/m 16.4FT produces up to 1200 Lumens of 3000K warm light and CRI over 90Ra,Equivalent to traditional light bulb 60W, and more uniform light angle avoiding black in the middle area. 【Safe and User-friendly】Compared to regular LED strip lights,the light is soft and uniform,which is safer to your eyes.With real double-layer FPCB board,the BTF-LIGHTING FCOB LED Strip Light has better heat dissipation than others,it's safe for children and pets 【Power calculation】The actual power of 16.4FT FCOB LED strip will be affected by the voltage drop. For example, the power of DC24V 16.4FT 320LEDs /m is 35W, not 10W/mx5m= 50W .and the voltage drop should be actually considered,and The linked part needs to be Charged by a new power supply 【Cuttable and Linkable】FCOB is flexiable LED strip.The Spots to solder can be cut .Two 5.5mmx2.1mm DC Plugs on two ends ,one is female the other one is male .It also support end to end connect in series without deepening brightness 【 Easy Install&Widely Use】Widely Application.Suitable for interior decoration. Such as kitchen, cabinet, bedroom, stair, mirror, corridor, DIY backlight, table lamp, toy light, DIY lighting, special use and other lighting.Come with double-side tape (IP30 non-waterproof Indoor Use Only). Work with Controller or Power supply directly. 【Which's Included and Which Not】 1)1X 16.4FT FCOB LED strip,Adhansive and Power supply is included. 2) Unlike the traditional LED strip light, there is no Power supply,accessories ,and no controller either; 3)The USB connector can be used for Power Supply from TV&PC 【Energy efficient and We Promise】FCOB LED strip lights of single color series is more energy efficient . It is dimmable and durable with more than 50000 hours lifespan. We also provide 12 months worry-free warranty and 24/7 customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d+8xf6g+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUPUP","source_asin":"B0C234DTH3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C234DTH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C234DTH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
