window.products.push({"id":824177,"name":"GOPORT 4pcs Insulated Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags, Heavy Duty Large Tote Bag Set with Extra Long Handles Thermal Lining Grocery Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGnR4BVXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thermal Grocery Bags – Our super durable reusable tote bags maintain their shape like a box even when fully loaded with groceries, books, toys, and everything else you need to carry. Each multi-purpose box bag is crafted from top quality materials with thermal lining to keep the food warm or cool. Considerate Large Tote Bags – Best shopping bags for groceries! Structured design and spill proof lining so items stay put while driving. No more groceries rolling around in the trunk. Bananas, bread, produce and other soft items won't be damaged on your way home. Collapsible for Easy Storage – Collapse and fold flat into a small size to save space and store compactly in your car trunk, back seat pocket, kitchen drawer, or cabinet. You don’t have to worry about grocery bags taking up and crowding space. Eliminate the need for disposable plastic bags with stylish, reusable, and sustainable large tote bag. Versatile Grocery Bags: Multi-purpose and can be used for various occasions at the supermarket, farmers market, school, work, beach, picnics, and for outdoor activities or general shopping due to the thermal lining. Perfect for packing your groceries, carrying library books or art supplies, bringing food for a picnic, using for holiday work gift baskets, transporting gifts, carrying your gym clothes or beach towels functional yet fashionable. Easy to Clean - Environmental non-woven surface with thick thermal waterproof lining, easy to clean with wet cloth. You don’t have to be concerned about getting your grocery bag dirty or stained with our grocery bag which is extremely easy to maintain","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jGnR4BVXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOPORT","source_asin":"B0C7RJL1C1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7RJL1C1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7RJL1C1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":824178,"name":"KUTANI YAKI(ware) Vase Range of mountains","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":68.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511I6OTaCrL._AC_SL1098_.jpg","description":"Japan KUTANI A stone monument bearing the inscription \"Ko-Kutani kiln ruins\" stands quietly in a clearing. It marks the spot where the Daishouji Clan(a branch of the Kaga Clan) established a kiln in about 1655,to make use of the local porcelain stone. Tha porcelain ware that was created there was later called \"Ko-kutani\" and became the foundation for Japanese colored porcelain ware. Rich overglaze colors applied with fluid brushwork -green,yellow,red,purple and blue- give Kutani porcelain its characteristic beauty. However,only half a century later the kiln was abadoned for reasons that nobody knows. About 100 years later,Kutani porcelain was revived under the patronage of the Kaga clan. The Kasugayama and Wakasugi kilns were established, and kilns such as the Yoshidaya kiln rode on the momentum of \"revived Kutani\",all producing overglaze porcelain ware. Various styles competed and combined to develop into the overlaze techniques that have been handed down to this day. In modern times,the gorgeous Kinrande style(very high-quality design of gold) has become well known in the West as \"Japan Kutani\" Kutani porcelain, which combined the artistry of Ko-Kutani ware and the utilitarian beauty that developed from \"revived Kutani\",continues to evolve.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511I6OTaCrL._AC_SL1098_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kutani","source_asin":"B017NCDGE4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NCDGE4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NCDGE4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
