window.products.push({"id":824263,"name":"Espresso Coffee Stirrer, CODOGOY Professional Coffee WDT Tool for Espresso Distribution with 49 mm Puck Screen, Natural Wood Handle Needle Type Distri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717OALX6OLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Espresso Coffee Stirrer】: This is an excellent fine WDT tool, using the coffee stirrer can help you break most of the coffee powder agglomeration, make the density of the coffee more uniform, and improve the splash problem caused by the fine powder agglomeration during the brewing process, to promote more uniform extraction and better mellow and delicious espresso. 【Espresso Distribution Tool with 4 Fine Needles】: Our espresso stirrer’s handle is made of Walnut wood with a smooth and polished surface for a comfortable grip. Coffee stirrer needle is made of 304 stainless steel, which is rust-proof, non-stick, not easily deformed or broken. It also comes with a solid wood stand, more convenient to place after stirring. 【Espresso Puck Screen】: Made of the high-quality 316 stainless steel, good filtering effect. Our reusable 1.7mm Thickness 100μm puck filter screen helps prevent coffee grounds from sticking to the espresso machine shower screen, Keeps brew head clean and protects the brew head from grounds being sucked up when Lever is lifted. 【Espresso Portafilter Lower Shower Screen】: This puck screen will disperse water evenly, increase the amount of solids that dissolve into the espresso, helping you get better extraction. Just tamper and place. It over the Portafilter filter basket, which helps you make delicious and mellow coffee drinks. 【Walnut Cleaning Brush】: Made of quality fiber hair, durable, flexible, and moisture-resistant, Easy to clean the dirt and powder; easily keep your Espresso Coffee Stirrer and portafilter or other coffee accessories from coffee grounds residue, cleaning all the nooks and crannies. 【Package included】: You will receive there is 1 piece coffee distributor tool matched including with a wooden stand . A walnut cleaning brush and a espresso puck screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717OALX6OLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CODOGOY","source_asin":"B09ZNM5V17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824263","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZNM5V17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZNM5V17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
