window.products.push({"id":824271,"name":"Vinturi Traditional Lever Wine Opener Includes Foil Cutter, 1, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m2R8yBeNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This offers an exquisite and classical presentation, certain to impress your most discerning guests and enhance the serving of your exceptional wine selection. By simply pressing down on the handle, the cork is removed and another two, seamless motions allow the cork to be freed from the corkscrew. Includes foil cutter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71m2R8yBeNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vinturi","source_asin":"B01L20MWQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01L20MWQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01L20MWQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":824272,"name":"JOZEFINA ATELIER Beauty VASE 48H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gZvR8UKUL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The Jozefina Factory was founded in 1982 by Jozef Jankowski, a well-known artist and glass blower. His daughter-Ella Jankowska Fishman has emerged as a leading glass designer. Her designs bring a breath of freshness to the art glass world. Jozefina Art Glass Atelier is recognized worldwide as a leading European manufacturer of hand blown art glass combining sophisticated, classical and contemporary design with highly skilled craftsmanship. Inspired design, expressive style, beautiful and elegant shapes make our art glass unusual and innovative. Each piece is hand blown and hand finished which makes every item artistic and unique. At Jozefina we value the old, traditional techniques of glass blowing dated back as far as the 10th century. We are located in Krosno-Poland, the oldest glass and crystal producing area in Europe. The artistic skill of fine art glass blowing has been passed down through the family generations. Our masters glass blowers create art rarely found today. We are delighted to introduce a wide variety of shapes and vibrant colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gZvR8UKUL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOZEFINA ATELIER","source_asin":"B01M8G4UVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824272","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M8G4UVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M8G4UVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":824273,"name":"Modus Furniture Urban Loft Bed with Synthetic Leather Headboard Panel, King, Chocolate Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617eSb3invL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Urban Loft collection is designed to bring comfort, style and function to metropolitan bedroom settings. Case goods are scaled to fit comfortably in urban spaces and, at 55 inch high, the bed stands out without overpowering the overall room decor. Solid wood drawers are constructed with English dovetail joinery and use full extension ball bearing glides for smooth, easy operation. The media chest accommodates televisions up to 55 inches while the luxurious padded leatherette headboard creates a perfect setting to relax and enjoy a movie. The Urban Loft collection is built to last with metal-to-metal bed rail fittings, center leg supports, Tropical Mahogany solid wood, Eastern Ash wood veneer and a multi-step American-style finish. Features the all-new under bed storage system from Modus with 4 free standing, fully enclosed, fully assembled dust proof drawers. Sanded and stained solid wood drawer boxes with full extension drawer glides and front and rear English dovetail joinery. Luxurious padded synthetic leather headboard panel. 12 solid wood slats with center leg supports for use with or without a box spring. Hook-on bed rail fittings for easy assembly and long term durability. Constructed from Tropical Mahogany solid wood, Tropical Mahogany wood veneer, leatherette upholstery, flame retardant polyurethane foam. Elegant sleigh style headboard with thick solid wood posts matches a wide range of contemporary and transitional bedroom decor. Simple assembly procedure to bolt drawer boxes to bed rails. Modus Furniture International (MFI) is a leading manufacturer and distributor of contemporary and transitional bedroom, dining room, and home entertainment furniture. Their products are designed for today’s lifestyle and engineered to offer top quality and exceptional value. In business since 1994, Modus Furniture is sold in all 50 states and throughout North America by retailers who recognize their commitment to value, quality and service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617eSb3invL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modus Furniture","source_asin":"B004GTO3A4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004GTO3A4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004GTO3A4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":824274,"name":"Fixseed Faux Fur Cowhide Rug for Living Room, 4.6 x 5.2 Feet Cute Non Slip Animal Print Area Rug, Cow Hide Print Rug for Western Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mQJRT4A7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐑【Animal Print Rug with Short Pile】: This faux cowhide rug is made of high-quality faux fur. Although the fluff is short, it offers the soft and cozy touch. Not a real cowhide, but imitating animal textures, add texture and interest to your room. Tight and fluffy short pile, with firm fluff, hardly sheds carpet fibers. 🐑【Cute Rugs for Bedroom Aesthetic】: This faux animal print rug can be as cute rugs for living room decor, bedroom rug decor, any room rug decor, dining room rugs, bathroom rugs, doormats and cloakroom rugs, or as a tapestry, making the whole room full of wildness, charm and artistic atmosphere. 🐑【No Curling or Rolling Up】: This cow hide print rug comes with a non slip backing of artificial suede, which adheres well to the floor and wrinkle-free. This durable suede backing is soft enough to be machine washable. 🐑【Suitable Size】: This animal skin rug is THIN BUT soft your feet will love it. One size of the carpet is 4.6*5.2 Feet (55*63 Inches), please measure the size before buying. It is in a low traffic seldom used area. For a dorm, starter apartment, foyer, sofa, living room, office and bedroom, just to add some affordable style. 🐑【Dirt Resistant And Easy to Clean】: This washable rug we recommend manual scrub with a wet cloth and hang dry for daily cleaning. If a deeper cleaning is needed, machine wash separately on the gentle cycle with mild detergent. Do not tumble or machine dry, and let air dry flat, avoid sun exposure.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mQJRT4A7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fixseed","source_asin":"B0B7X29FVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7X29FVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7X29FVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
