window.products.push({"id":824591,"name":"Candle Wand - Candle Cutter - Restores Unsightly Pillar Candles To New","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Mh0H1mrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Great Candle Accessory For Pillar Candle Lovers! The Candle Wand is the solution for pillar style candles, quickly solving the problems of wax spillage, submerged wick and low light level. As well as increasing the life and beauty of pillar style candles by re-creating a level candle surface for safer burning. Simple And Safe To Use The Candle Wand is a candle cutting and resurfacing tool that resembles a knife, yet has no sharp cutting edges. Similar to a hair curling iron, you simply plug it in and the blade heats up to a constant temperature of 350 degrees Fahrenheit [this is a safe wax melting temperature] to allow users to cut off the uneven portion of the pillar candle using the blade's heat. The controlled temperature eliminates smoke and minimizes over-melting to allow the user to smoothly slice off excess wax from the candle. Looking For A Memorable Gift Idea? A little something out of the ordinary? Candle Wands are LOVED by men and women and are PERFECT for any occasion: Birthdays Anniversaries Weddings Thank You's Business Gifts Housewarming Gifts Bachelor/Bachelorette Parties Religious Ceremonies A Candle Wand is an unforgettable gift! CARE INSTRUCTIONS Let wax run off the wand after use and wipe with a rag! Easy as that. Never again will you entertain friends and family with overflowing, ugly and lopsided candles. Click \"Add to Cart\" NOW! You'll wish you had these years ago!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Mh0H1mrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candle Wand","source_asin":"B00MFY72TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MFY72TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MFY72TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
