window.products.push({"id":824597,"name":"SEIKO 14\" Coca-Cola® Red Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719U7IexFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At first glance, Seiko and The Coca-Cola Company could not seem more different. But if you take a closer look, you'll find two timeless classics that are rooted in a rich history, strong virtues and positive outlooks. A shared history. At exactly the same time as Kintaro Hattori was planning to open his Seikosha factory and to create his first ever wall clock, Doc Pemberton in Atlanta, Georgia created a drink that would soon sweep the world. A shared commitment to doing things right, worldwide. Both Seiko and Coca-Cola see the world as one and work hard to serve the communities that sustain us and to protect the environment on which our futures depend. A shared love of sport. Ever since it became the first ever sponsor of the Olympic Games, Coca-Cola has been associated with the Olympic Games continuously since 1928, longer than any other corporate supporter. Seiko, too, is committed to the growth of sport and the positive values that it represents. When we discovered these synergies and similarities, it felt very right that they should be celebrated in a collection of clocks that express them. This collectible Coca-Cola wall clock adds a retro feel to any space. It has a classic round design with bold numbers in black that are easy to read. It has been made with superior craftsmanship that ensures years of reliable timekeeping. Powered by 1 AA battery (included). Overall dimensions 14. 4 X 3 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719U7IexFwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B07VXLPPNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VXLPPNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VXLPPNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
