window.products.push({"id":824960,"name":"Edgecraft 640 International Professional Food Slicer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PEW3ND54L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Chef'sChoice International Professional Food Slicer. Amazon.com Edgecraft Chef's Choice electric food slicer incorporates many of the features found in commercial units. Constructed of heavy-duty, rugged aluminum and stainless steel with a powerful 130 watt condenser motor for efficient, smooth, and extremely quiet operation, this slicer has a fully hardened 7-inch solid surgical stainless-steel blade that works well with bread, meats, cheese, vegetables, and more. Its cantilevered design allows for large trays and platters and easy access for cleaning, while the food carriage retracts fully to permit slicing of extra-large roasts, hams, and other foods. It also includes a convenient serving tray. --Jane DePaolo From the Manufacturer The Chef’sChoice Professional Slicer 640 offers many of the features found in commercial units including a powerful, extremely quiet 124-watt condenser motor, gear drive operation and heavy duty, rugged key components of aluminum and stainless steel construction. The 7-inch (170-mm) fully hardened stainless steel blade effortlessly and efficiently slices meats, cheeses, breads, fruits and vegetables from deli-thin to 1/2-inch. The food carriage retracts fully for extra large roasts and the Euro-style cantilever design accommodates larger trays, combining the tasks of preparation and presentation. This design also permits easy access to key parts of the slicer, making clean up a breeze. The blade can be easily removed for cleaning. Rubber feet provide excellent stability and hold the slicer securely to the work surface. A convenient automatic on/off switch is built into food carriage handle for added safety and slicing control. A handy serving tray is included.. One year limited warranty. 14.5 by 11.5 by 10 inches. 13 pounds. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41PEW3ND54L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef’sChoice","source_asin":"B00004RKFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-824960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004RKFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004RKFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
